しい文字は「ASMR」、入れてもごちゃつかないようであれば名前(下の名前だけで大丈夫です、表記の仕方はお任せします)\n\n本人イメージがスチームパンク×大正ロマン、種族が空狐、モチーフフラワーが椿、イメージカラーが臙脂色(#9B003F)、葡萄茶(#640125)なので、制作の際に活かせそうであれば使っていただけますと幸いです。\n\nよろしくお願い致します！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Niiro_hy/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a707b371/uploads/origins/b22eacc1-a61b-4280-aad4-6fd4392b796c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c35b3c6620cc3f7f4abcd4fe9331da4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a707b371/uploads/origins/b22eacc1-a61b-4280-aad4-6fd4392b796c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c35b3c6620cc3f7f4abcd4fe9331da4, https://si.imgix.net/a707b371/uploads/origins/b22eacc1-a61b-4280-aad4-6fd4392b796c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a358c6c8f8900937efa9d1db001d37b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a707b371/uploads/origins/b22eacc1-a61b-4280-aad4-6fd4392b796c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fd1f548e54f1c7556647984fb5d9abf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "secret, moonlit sky\n\n\nMy name is Yashamiya, a personal VTuber. My name is Eagle.\n\nI have been waiting for the opening of skeb. Please excuse my request.\n\nWhat I would like to ask for\nA generic logo for an original chat distribution.\nThe text should be \"Confirmation of Survival\". The text should read \"Confirmation of Survival\".\n\nIt is not urgent, so I would appreciate it if you could consider it.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/hasami_chokin/status/1596845075396366337?t=ZWyzDOsR9-s1eI2h0hSSkQ&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Niiro_hy/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/27383299/uploads/origins/a3caa98d-b1fe-4f28-8497-0982f92bc646?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09100df40e31bcadd43ae02a9ca65dcf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27383299/uploads/origins/a3caa98d-b1fe-4f28-8497-0982f92bc646?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09100df40e31bcadd43ae02a9ca65dcf, https://si.imgix.net/27383299/uploads/origins/a3caa98d-b1fe-4f28-8497-0982f92bc646?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ef453889def65d13fbc73a63898dde8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/27383299/uploads/origins/a3caa98d-b1fe-4f28-8497-0982f92bc646?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01177256fea324678da3ef5fee7b5f8d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for your wonderful autographs! I would like to request another set, this time for a friend.\nIt will be for personal use only.\n\n▷Character\nJiwoon, 21, Female, 178 cm\nShe is a Korean idol that specializes in dark tone music. Mean and moody.\n\n▷Request\nI would like to request an autograph for her. Please make it sharp and cool!\nHer nickname is \"siren,\" so please include a mermaid's tail in at least one of the autographs.\nIf possible, please have one of the autographs be in Korean: 차지운.\n\n▷Details\nOther possible motifs: lipstick, diamonds.\nYou do not need to include these!\n\nPlease put your signature on a separate layer in the PSD.\n\nThank you for considering my request!\nI'm not sure why my messages aren't translating...please forgive me.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aTW-SEyBlvrZApbdv1hTo5h7VuQsdUyM", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Niiro_hy/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ba21a08a/uploads/origins/c1cd52a5-2cc0-4f03-b86c-aa74b7d947b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81f5c837ec114cd02c76ddef7a266d2f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ba21a08a/uploads/origins/c1cd52a5-2cc0-4f03-b86c-aa74b7d947b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81f5c837ec114cd02c76ddef7a266d2f, https://si.imgix.net/ba21a08a/uploads/origins/c1cd52a5-2cc0-4f03-b86c-aa74b7d947b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24593baba87b8e55dcdcea97fd4af3b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ba21a08a/uploads/origins/c1cd52a5-2cc0-4f03-b86c-aa74b7d947b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e1eb43503cb855b725d084ca5701f3d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "蜜月にいろ先生、はじめまして。\nI saw your signature (https://www.foriio.com/works/393672) samples and really like them! I would like to request one for an OC.\nIt will be for personal use only.\n\n▷Character\nYuna, 17, female\nA gentle and healing type idol. Her fans call her their angel.\n\n▷Request\nI would like to request a signature for her.\nHer motif is a rabbit, so if possible, I would like that to be included in the signature.\n\n▷Details\nOther possible motifs: cherry blossoms, angel wings.\nYou do not need to include these!\n\nPlease put your signature on a separate layer in the PSD.\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i7Ql7JXIWUzWP99Btmdd6BP5EFhA0erq?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}